MCDurableStepZeroServed.cfg	QuePaxaDurable.tla	red	StepZeroDurableStateWasNeverServed
MCTornAtomic.cfg	QuePaxaTornWrite.tla	green
MCTornAtomicUnvalidated.cfg	QuePaxaTornWrite.tla	green
MCTornRefusedTear.cfg	QuePaxaTornWrite.tla	red	DurableStateIsRestorable
